# Replace @DESIGNER and @ENG_LEAD with real GitHub handles or teams (for example @org/engineers).
# Last matching pattern wins. Any one listed owner can approve, and the PR author cannot approve
# their own PR, so a designer PR in design-owned paths always needs an engineer's approval.

# Default
*                                      @ENG_LEAD

# Design-owned (engineer reviews)
/lib/core/design_system/               @DESIGNER @ENG_LEAD
/lib/features/*/presentation/          @DESIGNER @ENG_LEAD
/lib/features/*/data/mock/             @DESIGNER @ENG_LEAD
/docs/DESIGN.md                        @DESIGNER @ENG_LEAD

# Engineer-owned
/lib/features/*/domain/                @ENG_LEAD
/lib/features/*/data/remote/           @ENG_LEAD
/lib/features/*/data/local/            @ENG_LEAD
/lib/core/config/                      @ENG_LEAD
/lib/core/di/                          @ENG_LEAD
/lib/core/error/                       @ENG_LEAD
/docs/ARCHITECTURE.md                  @ENG_LEAD
/docs/decisions/                       @ENG_LEAD
/.github/                              @ENG_LEAD
/tool/                                 @ENG_LEAD
